  "notes": "{取得|しゅとく}する is composed of {取|しゅ} (take) + {得|とく} (gain, obtain).\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: Transitive ({他動詞|たどうし})\n- Pattern: 〜を{取得|しゅとく}する\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {資格|しかく}を{取得|しゅとく}する: to obtain a qualification\n- {免許|めんきょ}を{取得|しゅとく}する: to obtain a license\n- {特許|とっきょ}を{取得|しゅとく}する: to obtain a patent\n- データを{取得|しゅとく}する: to acquire data\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {取得|しゅとく}する: to acquire (formal, official process)\n- {得|え}る: to obtain, to gain (general)\n- {取|と}る: to take, to get (everyday, informal)",
